  <Prefabs>
    <Prefab xsi:type="MyObjectBuilder_PrefabDefinition">
      <Id Type="MyObjectBuilder_PrefabDefinition" Subtype="Prefab_Bastion_VI-X" />
        <DisplayName>Bastion VI-X</DisplayName>
        <Description>When a premium tier client delivered a bare-metal structural skeleton to our drydocks, the directive was clear: transform a basic functional layout into an uncompromising, survival-ready mobile command asset. Volsung engineers stripped back the frame, reinforced the chassis, and integrated a complete production and deep-space traversal suite without sacrificing atmospheric flight capabilities.

The result is the Bastion VI-X. A self-sustaining fortress designed to operate entirely independent of orbital logistics.</Description>
        <Icon>Textures\GUI\Icons\VIX Prefabs\Bastion_VI-X.dds</Icon>
        <TooltipImage>Textures\GUI\Icons\VIX Prefabs\Bastion_VI-X_Tooltip.png</TooltipImage>
        <EnvironmentType>All</EnvironmentType>
